[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS006
TITLE: Request taxi and read back the taxi clearance
STATEMENT: >>>
From the ramp the aircraft shall request taxi to its configured runway. A taxi clearance that includes hold short shall be read back with both the taxi instruction and the hold-short runway, and the aircraft shall then taxi toward the hold-short point. The position shall not change until step is called. Acceptance is the readback Taxi to runway two seven, hold short runway two seven, followed by the call sign, and a later stop at the hold-short point.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Taxi is the first ground maneuver and the readback has to include the hold.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
